      "persona": "Universal Persona Content",
      "taskMessage": "<b>Asha Moreno:</b> Harborview Expo opens tomorrow, and staff are already reporting badge warnings, support calls, unwanted calendar invites, and suspicious app links. Each message looks minor alone, but together they may be a coordinated <b>social engineering</b> campaign.\n\nPreserve what you find, slow the pressure down, and never blame the people being targeted. Start with the incident intake, {player}.",
      "taskInstructions": "",
      "taskQuestion": "",
      "taskCompleteText": "<b>Asha Moreno:</b> Begin with the intake. It puts the first reports side by side."
    }
